[statement]
As `carried-names-are-decided-the-last-numbered-first`, with one package
depending on both names: `a` states `x` before `y`, so the walk numbers
`y` last, and `y` is decided first, for 2, which holds `K`.

[repository]
P:a
V:1
D:x y

P:c
V:1

P:x
V:2
p:K=1

P:x
V:1

P:y
V:2
p:K=1

P:y
V:1

[request]
a
c

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install x 1
install y 2
install a 1
install c 1
